    <div class="list-item">
        <strong>(2) Transducer ID Cable assembly:</strong> TEDS to Extensometer, PT connector, 25.5k Ohm Shunt Resistor, Compatible with controller and extensometer, Length 1.5m, Temperature Range -100°C to +175°C, Strain Range +/-50% / -10%</li>
        <li>Acceptable manufacturer: MTS PN 5727608; or model with equivalent specifications</li>
